SigLIP SO400M 384 for Core ML
Copyright 2026 miracle2k contributors

This distribution contains a converted form of
google/siglip-so400m-patch14-384, revision
9fdffc58afc957d1a03a25b10dba0329ab15c2a3, which declares the Apache License
2.0.

Modifications include extracting the vision tower, adding L2 normalization to
the exported graph, converting it to a Core ML ML Program, and applying scalar
per-tensor k-means palettization.

SigLIP was introduced by Zhai et al. in "Sigmoid Loss for Language Image
Pre-Training" (https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.15343).

